% Method > Agent-based simulation of BEV ridesourcing fleets on trip data from New York City and San Francisco.
% Findings > With a sparse network of 3 to 4 50 kW chargers per square mile, BEVs match ICEV service at lower cost; coordinated charger use makes fleet performance robust to battery range and charger placement.
